      "h1": "Marini Hor Drill",
      "description": "Hor Drill is a pneumatic drilling unit for horizontal holes the diamond wire passes through. With a pneumatic rotary head and a down-the-hole (DTH) hammer it reaches depths of 25 - 30 metres even in r",
